NOTE ON THIRD-PARTY AND GAME CONTENT

This license covers the code in this repository only.

Myth Forge is an unofficial fan project. It is not produced by, endorsed by,
supported by, or affiliated with Wizards of the Coast LLC. Magic: The Gathering
and all associated card names, rules text, mana symbols, frame designs and
other game content are trademarks and copyrights of Wizards of the Coast.

This repository bundles NO Wizards-copyrighted frame artwork. The optional
official-style M15 frames are rendered from a Card Conjurer installation that
you supply yourself; do not commit those assets here. Card data and card images
are fetched at runtime from the Scryfall API under Scryfall's terms. The
bundled frame assets under `card_assets/` are sourced from
wingedsheep/mtg-card-generator. AI model weights (FLUX, SDXL, LoRAs, Hunyuan3D,
LTX-Video, Wan) are not distributed here and remain under their own licenses.

Cards produced by this tool are proxies for personal, non-commercial playtesting.
